<title>FRANCE: Havas Q1 sales rise to 14.74 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Havas Q1 sales rise to 14.74 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					14,741    vs   11,002</p>
<p>     - audiovisual				 7,011    vs    3,634</p>
<p>     - information and publishing	    2,396    vs    2,314</p>
<p>     - local media				 2,500    vs    2,414</p>
<p>     - travel and leisure			2,834    vs    2,640</p>
<p>NOTE - Havas said 1997 first-quarter sales were 34 percent above year-earlier levels, but the rise at a constant structure and exchange rates was 6.4 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;Revenues reflect first full consolidation of Canal Plus and Havas Images, formerly Generale d'Images,&quot; Havas said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
